# Spaghetti Cacio E Cepe

Based on [Chrissy Teigen Cravings](https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/252973/cravings-by-chrissy-teigen-with-adeena-sussman/) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251202235345/https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/252973/cravings-by-chrissy-teigen-with-adeena-sussman/)), pg. 78

{ rating="2" image="spaghetti_cacio_e_cepe.jpg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 1/2 box of [Spaghetti]{ ing="spaghetti" }
- [ ] 1/4 lb [pancetta]{ ing="pancetta" }, diced
- [ ] 2 tsp [Olive Oil]{ ing="olive-oil" }
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [red pepper flakes]{ ing="red-pepper-flakes" }
- [ ] 2 tsp [black pepper]{ ing="black-pepper" }
- [ ] 4 cloves [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, minced
- [ ] 1/4 cup [lemon juice]{ ing="lemon-juice" }
- [ ] 1.5 & 1/2 cups [Parmesan]{ ing="parmesan" }, grated and divided
- [ ] 3 cups [baby arugula]{ ing="baby-arugula" }

## Recipe

1. Start a large pot of water to boil and prep the cheese, [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, and [lemon juice]{ ing="lemon-juice" }.
1. Crisp the [pancetta]{ ing="pancetta" } for 7-9 minutes in a large skillet at medium-high heat. In parallel, boil the [spaghetti]{ ing="spaghetti" } (10 minutes).
1. Add the [Olive Oil]{ ing="olive-oil" }, [red pepper flakes]{ ing="red-pepper-flakes" }, [black pepper]{ ing="black-pepper" }, and [garlic]{ ing="garlic" } to the skillet and cook for 1 min. Set aside a small cup of pasta water.
1. Combine the [lemon juice]{ ing="lemon-juice" }, [spaghetti]{ ing="spaghetti" }, and [Parmesan]{ ing="parmesan" } cheese. Add a small amount of pasta water as needed to help melt the cheese.
1. Add the [baby arugula]{ ing="baby-arugula" } and allow to wilt for 2 minutes.
